tral Large Instruct";s:37:"model_mistral.mistral-small-2402-v1:0";s:22:"Mistral Small Instruct";s:40:"model_mistral.mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0:1";s:21:"Mixtral 8X7B Instruct";s:32:"model_stability.sd3-5-large-v1:0";s:39:"Stability AI Stable Diffusion 3.5 Large";s:38:"model_stability.stable-image-core-v1:1";s:34:"Stability AI Stable Image Core 1.1";s:39:"model_stability.stable-image-ultra-v1:1";s:35:"Stability AI Stable Image Ultra 1.1";s:4:"none";s:4:"None";s:10:"pluginname";s:23:"Amazon Bedrock provider";s:16:"privacy:metadata";s:68:"The Amazon Bedrock provider plugin does not store any personal data.";s:54:"privacy:metadata:aiprovider_awsbedrock:externalpurpose";s:248:"This information is sent to Amazon Web Services (AWS) in order for a response to be generated. Your AWS account settings may change how AWS stores and retains this data. No user data is explicitly sent to AWS or stored in Moodle LMS by this plugin.";s:44:"privacy:metadata:aiprovider_awsbedrock:model";s:40:"The model used to generate the response.";s:51:"privacy:metadata:aiprovider_awsbedrock:numberimages";s:65:"When generating images the number of images used in the response.";s:49:"privacy:metadata:aiprovider_awsbedrock:prompttext";s:59:"The user entered text prompt used to generate the response.";s:53:"privacy:metadata:aiprovider_awsbedrock:responseformat";s:50:"The format of the response when generating images.";s:8:"settings";s:8:"Settings";s:18:"settings_cfg_scale";s:36:"Classifier-Free Guidance (CFG) scale";s:23:"settings_cfg_scale_help";s:193:"Specifies how strongly the generated image should adhere to the prompt. Use a lower value to introduce more randomness in the generation. Min: {$a->min}, Max: {$a->max}, Default: {$a->default}.";s:31:"settings_cross_region_inference";s:22:"Cross region inference";s:36:"settings_cross_region_inference_help";s:63:"The inference profile ID for this model. Default: {$a->default}";s:26:"settings_frequency_penalty";s:17:"Frequency penalty";s:31:"settings_frequency_penalty_help";s:183:"The frequency penalty adjusts how often words are repeated. The higher the penalty, the less repetitions in the generated text. Min: {$a->min}, Max: {$a->max}, Default: {$a->default}.";s:13:"settings_help";s:79:"Adjust the settings below to customise how requests are sent to Amazon Bedrock.";s:19:"settings_max_tokens";s:10:"Max tokens";s:24:"settings_max_tokens_help";s:110:"The maximum number of tokens used to generate content. Min: {$a->min}, Max: {$a->max}, Default: {$a->default}.";s:28:"settings_negative_prompt_img";s:15:"Negative prompt";s:33:"settings_negative_prompt_img_help";s:172:"Specifies keywords describing elements that should be excluded from the generated image. Enter words or short phrases separated by commas. Maximum length: 10,000 characters";s:25:"settings_presence_penalty";s:16:"Presence penalty";s:30:"settings_presence_penalty_help";s:241:"Reduce the frequency of repeated words within a single message by increasing this number. Unlike frequency penalty, presence penalty is the same no matter how many times a word appears. Min: {$a->min}, Max: {$a->max}, Default: {$a->default}.";s:23:"settings_schema_version";s:14:"Schema version";s:28:"settings_schema_version_help";s:62:"Schema version to use for the request. Default: {$a->default}.";s:13:"settings_seed";s:4:"Seed";s:18:"settings_seed_help";s:202:"Ensures consistent results when using the same seed and parameters. While results are usually repeatable, total consistency isn't 100% guaranteed. Min: {$a->min}, Max: {$a->max}, Default: {$a->default}.";s:17:"settings_seed_img";s:4:"Seed";s:22:"settings_seed_img_help";s:372:"Determines the initial noise setting for the generation process. Changing the seed value while leaving all other parameters the same will produce a totally new image that still adheres to your prompt, dimensions, and other settings. It is common to experiment with a variety of seed values to find the perfect image. Min: {$a->min}, Max: {$a->max}, Default: {$a->default}.";s:23:"settings_stop_sequences";s:13:"Stop sequence";s:28:"settings_stop_sequences_help";s:69:"Specify a character sequence to indicate where the model should stop.";s:20:"settings_temperature";s:11:"Temperature";s:25:"settings_temperature_help";s:110:"Use a lower value to decrease randomness in responses. Min: {$a->min}, Max: {$a->max}, Default: {$a->default}.";s:14:"settings_top_k";s:5:"Top K";s:19:"settings_top_k_help";s:117:"Only sample from the top K options for each subsequent token. Min: {$a->min}, Max: {$a->max}, Default: {$a->default}.";s:14:"settings_top_p";s:5:"Top P";s:19:"settings_top_p_help";s:146:"Use a lower value to ignore less probable options and decrease the diversity of responses. Min: {$a->min}, Max: {$a->max}, Default: {$a->default}.";}